<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cresud raised to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cresud raised to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said on Monday it had upgraded its rating for Argentina's Cresud to hold from underperform.</p>
<p>-- The upgrade was prompted by the stock's current valuation.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 0.010 peso to 1.870 in Buenos Aires.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
